Adapt ccpInit to crypton 2.1, where ChaChaPoly1305.initialize takes
an opaque Key built by ChaChaPoly1305.key and is total.

Index: src/Crypto/Store/CMS/Algorithms.hs
--- src/Crypto/Store/CMS/Algorithms.hs.orig
+++ src/Crypto/Store/CMS/Algorithms.hs
@@ -1333,8 +1333,8 @@
         -> ChaChaPoly1305.Nonce
         -> aad
         -> Either StoreError ChaChaPoly1305.State
-ccpInit key nonce aad = case ChaChaPoly1305.initialize key nonce of
-    CryptoPassed s -> return (addAAD s)
+ccpInit key nonce aad = case ChaChaPoly1305.key key of
+    CryptoPassed k -> return (addAAD (ChaChaPoly1305.initialize k nonce))
     CryptoFailed e -> Left (CryptoError e)
   where addAAD = ChaChaPoly1305.finalizeAAD . ChaChaPoly1305.appendAAD aad
 
